comments[11]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-06-25T00:12:20.747Z",codex-audit-20260625,"Evidence: compiled CLI now returns unknown_lifecycle_action for package descirbe/catalogx with suggested_retry pm package describe/catalog. Focused test passed: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/extensions/extension-command.spec.ts (110 tests)."
  "2026-06-25T00:42:17.795Z",codex-audit-20260625,"Evidence update: strict coverage initially caught new recovery branches; tests now cover exact action fallback, short typos, nearest later candidate ranking, and structured package recovery. Full release gate later passed literal 100/100/100/100 coverage."
  "2026-06-25T01:05:19.081Z",codex-audit-20260625,"PR review evidence: fixed lifecycle typo recovery to suggest executable flag-form commands such as pm package --catalog and pm package --explore; focused suite passed with 184 total tests across extension-command and sdk-compose."
  "2026-06-25T01:23:46.145Z",codex-audit-20260625,"PR review evidence: exact bare lifecycle targets that reach the error path now suggest executable flags, e.g. package install -> pm package --install; extension command suite passed again."
  "2026-06-25T01:24:18.501Z",codex-audit-20260625,"Correction: helper-level exact install recovery passed, but live pm package install --json currently still resolves as install without a source target; continuing the fix before final PR push."
  "2026-06-25T01:27:49.505Z",codex-audit-20260625,"Final evidence: after rebuilding dist, live node dist/cli.js package install --json emits code missing_lifecycle_target with suggested_retry pm package --install <source>; package catalogx/lis still recover to executable flag-form --catalog/--explore suggestions."
  "2026-06-25T01:37:25.627Z",codex-audit-20260625,"CI follow-up: PR run 28140792831 failed only the strict coverage gate at 99.99% branch coverage in src/cli/commands/extension.ts; replacing the lifecycle flag fallback with a typed action flag map and removing unnecessary positional --flag matching."
  "2026-06-25T01:42:32.609Z",codex-audit-20260625,"Coverage fix evidence: local node scripts/run-tests.mjs coverage passed literal Statements/Branches/Functions/Lines 100/100/100/100 after replacing the lifecycle fallback branch with an explicit action flag map."
  "2026-06-25T01:51:39.959Z",codex-audit-20260625,"CodeRabbit follow-up: missing-target recovery headline now uses the active vocabulary and target kind (for example package source), matching the structured required/examples/recovery payloads."
  "2026-06-25T01:56:46.562Z",codex-audit-20260625,"Integration follow-up: updated MCP package-install missing-target assertion to the new vocabulary-aware extension source input headline and linked the focused MCP integration test."
  "2026-06-25T02:01:20.696Z",codex-audit-20260625,"Final CodeRabbit evidence: live package install JSON now says requires package source input, linked MCP/unit tests passed, and full coverage passed literal 100/100/100/100."
